---
import KvizTraka from "./KvizTraka.astro";
---

<section class="block" id="simptomi">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div>
        <h2>Što primjećujete kod djeteta?</h2>
        <p class="lead" style="margin:0">Odaberite simptom i pročitajte što može značiti i kada treba na pregled.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cards">
      <a class="card" href="/simptomi/dijete-hrce/">
        <span class="go">→</span>
        <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M5 20c3-6 7-6 11 0s8 6 11 0"></path><path d="M9 11h4M19 11h4"></path></svg></span>
        <strong>Dijete hrče</strong>
        <small>Kada je hrkanje znak da nešto nije u redu</small>
      </a>
      <a class="card c2" href="/simptomi/disanje-na-usta/">
        <span class="go">→</span>
        <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32"><ellipse cx="16" cy="20" rx="6" ry="4"></ellipse><path d="M9 10h14"></path></svg></span>
        <strong>Diše na usta</strong>
        <small>Začepljen nos danju i noću</small>
      </a>
      <a class="card c3" href="/simptomi/bol-u-uhu/">
        <span class="go">→</span>
        <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M12 27c-4 0-5-4-5-8 0-7 4-13 10-13s9 4 9 9c0 4-3 5-5 7s-2 5-5 5"></path><path d="M14 15c0-3 5-3 5 0"></path></svg></span>
        <strong>Bol u uhu i česte upale</strong>
        <small>Otitis koji se stalno vraća</small>
      </a>
      <a class="card c4" href="/simptomi/slabiji-sluh/">
        <span class="go">→</span>
        <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M5 16h4l3-7 4 14 4-10 3 3h4"></path></svg></span>
        <strong>Slabije čuje ili kasni govor</strong>
        <small>Tekućina iza bubnjića</small>
      </a>
      <a class="card c5" href="/simptomi/ceste-angine/">
        <span class="go">→</span>
        <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32"><circle cx="11" cy="17" r="4.5"></circle><circle cx="21" cy="17" r="4.5"></circle><path d="M16 5v5"></path></svg></span>
        <strong>Česte angine</strong>
        <small>Krajnici kod djece i kada ih vaditi</small>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/simptomi/krvarenje-iz-nosa/">
        <span class="go">→</span>
        <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M16 5c5 7 8 11 8 15a8 8 0 0 1-16 0c0-4 3-8 8-15z"></path></svg></span>
        <strong>Krvarenje iz nosa</strong>
        <small>Što učiniti odmah i kada liječniku</small>
      </a>
      <a class="card c2" href="/simptomi/stanke-u-disanju/">
        <span class="go">→</span>
        <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M22 7a10 10 0 1 0 3 15 8 8 0 0 1-3-15z"></path></svg></span>
        <strong>Stanke u disanju u snu</strong>
        <small>Apneja u snu kod djece</small>
      </a>
      <a class="card c3" href="/simptomi/strano-tijelo/">
        <span class="go">→</span>
        <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32"><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="3.5"></circle><path d="M16 4v6M16 22v6M4 16h6M22 16h6"></path></svg></span>
        <strong>Nešto u nosu ili uhu</strong>
        <small>Strano tijelo kod djeteta</small>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p style="margin:22px 0 0"><a class="pill" href="/simptomi/">Svi simptomi →</a></p>
    <KvizTraka />
  </div>
</section>
